{"1769200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vividerie", "steam_appid": 1769200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vividerie</strong> is a brutal bullet hell roguelike with fast, precise action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, dash, and sling magic as you carve your way through hordes of vile creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through dangerous dungeons, unearth powerful relics, and build absurd synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tough, Precise Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vividerie is built for players who crave a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is punished, but mastery is rewarded just as fiercely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn demanding mechanics, weave through overwhelming bullet patterns, and craft ridiculous builds that push the game to its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 dungeons</strong>, each featuring fresh procedural layouts every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange rooms that can completely change the course of a run, and uncover secrets hidden in the cracks of the dungeon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wild Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>200+ items</strong> and combine them in countless ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with chaotic mixes of stat modifiers, effects, and proc chains that can turn a struggling run into an unstoppable one — or break it entirely.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vividerie</strong> is a brutal bullet hell roguelike with fast, precise action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, dash, and sling magic as you carve your way through hordes of vile creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through dangerous dungeons, unearth powerful relics, and build absurd synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tough, Precise Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vividerie is built for players who crave a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is punished, but mastery is rewarded just as fiercely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn demanding mechanics, weave through overwhelming bullet patterns, and craft ridiculous builds that push the game to its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>5 dungeons</strong>, each featuring fresh procedural layouts every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange rooms that can completely change the course of a run, and uncover secrets hidden in the cracks of the dungeon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wild Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>200+ items</strong> and combine them in countless ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with chaotic mixes of stat modifiers, effects, and proc chains that can turn a struggling run into an unstoppable one — or break it entirely.</p>", "short_description": "A brutal bullet hell roguelike. Shoot, dash, and cast magic through hordes of vile creatures. Discover powerful relics, craft absurd builds, and find yummy burger.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769200/header.jpg?t=1780596050", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780596050", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780596050", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syste